## About This Repository

This repository tracks my 30-day fullstack learning roadmap focused on becoming job-ready as a junior PHP/Laravel + React developer.

The goal is not only to finish tutorials, but to build real output every day:

- runnable code
- clean Git history
- notes and error logs
- README documentation
- practical backend/frontend features
- final fullstack project for portfolio

---

## Main Stack

| Area | Technology |
|---|---|
| Backend | PHP, Laravel |
| Frontend | ReactJS, TypeScript |
| Database | MySQL, SQL, PDO, Eloquent |
| Tools | Git, Docker, Postman |
| Quality | Testing, PHPStan, API docs |
| Deployment | Docker, CI/CD, production checklist |

